category: Devel
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Eliminate bugs and weeds from shell scripts"
ldesc: "roundup(1) is a unit testing tool for running roundup(5) test plans which are
written in any POSIX shell.  Each test in a plan is run in its own isolated
sandbox.  A test can pass, be ignored, or fail.  Failed tests output their set
-x trace."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/bmizerany/roundup
license: MIT
